      "message": "[Gerrit AI Review] ✅ **LGTM** — All checks pass. [[trajectory](go/traj/153e307e-1790-4bf7-a61e-209d544440e1)]\n\n### Review Summary\n\n*   **Functionality**: The `set_frame_size` test-only method is well-implemented and provides the necessary functionality for testing `FpFrameSizeCache`. The bounds checking logic correctly avoids integer underflow issues, and error handling logs are appropriate.\n*   **Style**: The code follows the style guidelines and is well documented. The docstrings accurately reflect the behavior.\n*   **Security**: No security risks. The added functionality is correctly wrapped in `#ifdef CONFIG_ZTEST`, ensuring test-only methods do not leak into production builds.\n*   **Testing**: The changes include robust unit tests (`test_set_frame_size`, `test_set_frame_size_boundary_max_index`, `test_set_frame_size_boundary_negative_index`) that verify the happy path as well as the out-of-bounds error handling.",
